          FACETARGET/POS/SPOS/CPOS/TROOP/SARG/BRUIS/HEAD/SKULL
          resolution (sequential ifs: 28-deep else-if overflows
          yacc) + doaction dispatch, P_FireWeapon NoiseAlert.
          REAL ENGINE BUGS FOUND: Limbo << looser than + (angle+
          (rand-rand)<<20 parses as (angle+rand)<<20 — every AI
